	I was on around dungeon level 14, went downstairs, leaving my
pretty huge cat above.  I stepped on a polymorph trap, but my cloak of
magic resistance prevented me from polymorphing.  Well, a dim bulb
appeared above my head, and I went right upstairs to get this pet of
mine, that would still be tame.  When a kitty steps on a poly trap,
chances are that it will be more powerful, since in the game, there
are many more powerful types of monster in the game.  So, I bring it
downstairs.  I lock all the doors.  I send a string of periods.  Well,
the stupid cat won't step on the damn trap.  I decide to throw a
lizard corpse on the trap.  Of course, kitty runs for it, steps on the
trap and..
*POOF*
